<title>FINLAND: Silja Q1 loss narrows to FIM 106 mln.</title>
<headline>Silja Q1 loss narrows to FIM 106 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to end-March-</p>
<p>	 (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Loss after financial items		     106 vs 128 loss</p>
<p> Net sales					    803 vs 761</p>
<p> Operating loss					36 vs 72 loss</p>
<p>NOTE - The median of analysts' forecast was for a 93 million markka loss after financial items, before extraordinary items ans tax.  </p>
<p> Operating profit before depreciation	  29 vs 7 loss</p>
<p> Depreciation					  65 vs 65</p>
<p> Net financial items			charge 70 vs 56 charge</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish passenger ferry operator is Silja Oy Ab. --Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
